<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">AYA has passed the practice questions she can be asked about Radiance Med Spa: the line she opens with, a price on your menu and one that isn&#39;t, a clinical question she must not answer, an urgent message from a client, an off-topic client and a question your answers don&#39;t cover. The ones about booking and deposits wait for her booking tools.</p>
