}</style>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#ffffff;color:#1f2328;">
<span style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;mso-hide:all;">Two flags from one clinic in a week is an alert. Look at both today.</span>
<div class="hd-wrap" style="max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px 16px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:#1f2328;background:#ffffff;">
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">A clinic flagged one of AYA&#39;s answers: 2 flags from it in 7 days, this one included. Two in a week is an alert, not a statistic. Today, read the flagged conversations&#39; outcomes and the clinic&#39;s knowledge in the console, decide whether the fix is the clinic&#39;s knowledge or AYA&#39;s own words, and write to the practice.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Staff typed a correction, screened as Knowledge screens a quick answer, which is already in the clinic&#39;s quick answers, and the practice questions run again on it. Read it in the clinic&#39;s knowledge in the console.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 4px;"><strong>Clinic id:</strong> 0c1d2e3f-0000-4000-8000-000000000000</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 4px;"><strong>Flag id:</strong> 7a2b3c4d-5e6f-4a1b-8c2d-3e4f5a6b7c8d</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 4px;"><strong>Conversation id:</strong> 1b2c3d4e-5f60-4718-9a2b-3c4d5e6f7a8b</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 4px;"><strong>Channel:</strong> Phone</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 4px;"><strong>Outcome:</strong> Answered</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 4px;"><strong>Correction:</strong> Yes</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 4px;"><strong>Flags in 7 days:</strong> 2</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 4px;"><strong>Flagged:</strong> 2026-10-06 14:32 UTC</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">The alert carries ids and counts only. The conversation&#39;s words are not kept: its transcript went to the clinic&#39;s own address, never to us.</p>
<hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #d0d7de;margin:24px 0 16px;">
<p class="hd-muted" style="margin:0 0 6px;color:#57606a;font-size:13px;">You&#39;re receiving this because this address is set as healdesk&#39;s ops alert address.</p>
<p class="hd-muted" style="margin:0 0 6px;color:#57606a;font-size:13px;">Replies reach the healdesk team. Please leave out patient details.</p>
<p class="hd-muted" style="margin:0 0 6px;color:#57606a;font-size:13px;">healdesk is a service of Viixi FZC, a company registered under the Sharjah Publishing City Free Zone, United Arab Emirates.</p>
<p class="hd-muted" style="margin:0 0 6px;color:#57606a;font-size:13px;">US mailing address (correspondence only): 800 N King Street, Suite 304-1426, Wilmington, DE 19801, United States</p>
</div>
</body>
</html>",
