  body, .hd-wrap { background: #0d1117 !important; color: #e6edf3 !important; }
  .hd-muted { color: #9da7b3 !important; }
  a { color: #8cc4ff !important; }
  a.hd-action { background: #e6edf3 !important; color: #0d1117 !important; }
}</style>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#ffffff;color:#1f2328;">
<span style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;mso-hide:all;">A change to a feature you already have. Nothing for you to do.</span>
<div class="hd-wrap" style="max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px 16px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:#1f2328;background:#ffffff;">
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">When a call or a website chat ends, AYA emails its transcript to your practice&#39;s address on healdesk, over an encrypted connection.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">healdesk keeps its copy only until your mail server confirms it has the email, and then deletes it. Conversations in your portal still show how each one ended and whether it led to a booking, with a receipt for each transcript email.</p>
<p style="margin:16px 0 24px;"><a class="hd-action" href="https://app.healdesk.test/c/radiance-med-spa/conversations" style="display:inline-block;background:#1f2328;color:#ffffff;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">Open Conversations</a></p>
