}</style>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#ffffff;color:#1f2328;">
<span style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;mso-hide:all;">Paying what you owe healdesk restores everything at once.</span>
<div class="hd-wrap" style="max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px 16px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:#1f2328;background:#ffffff;">
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Your healdesk invoice for $520 is unpaid, so we&#39;ve suspended your service.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">AYA has stopped answering on every channel: forwarded calls pass straight through to your direct line, and website chat becomes a contact form. Your data is kept, and you can still sign in to healdesk.</p>
<p style="margin:16px 0 24px;"><a class="hd-action" href="https://invoice.stripe.com/i/acct_testplatform/test_invoice" style="display:inline-block;background:#1f2328;color:#ffffff;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">Pay the invoice</a></p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Paying what you owe healdesk restores everything at once.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">If your clinic&#39;s line forwards to AYA, you can undo that while this is sorted out. Follow these Verizon steps, dialling each code from the clinic&#39;s own line:</p>
<ul style="margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:20px;"><li>Cancel busy and no-answer forwarding on a Verizon home phone: *43</li><li>If Verizon pointed your home phone&#39;s busy and no-answer forwarding at your assistant by service order instead, *43 doesn&#39;t undo it: ask Verizon to set it back to where it went before.</li><li>Cancel forwarding on a Verizon mobile line: *73</li></ul>
<hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #d0d7de;margin:24px 0 16px;">
<p class="hd-muted" style="margin:0 0 6px;color:#57606a;font-size:13px;">You&#39;re receiving this because this is the address on Radiance Med Spa&#39;s healdesk account.</p>
<p class="hd-muted" style="margin:0 0 6px;color:#57606a;font-size:13px;">Replies reach the healdesk team. Please leave out patient details.</p>
