  "subject": "AYA has stopped answering: your healdesk service is suspended",
  "text": "Your healdesk invoice for $520 is unpaid, so we've suspended your service.

AYA has stopped answering on every channel: forwarded calls pass straight through to your direct line, and website chat becomes a contact form. Your data is kept, and you can still sign in to healdesk.

