<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#ffffff;color:#1f2328;">
<span style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;mso-hide:all;">AYA has stopped answering. Reply and we&#39;ll tell you what&#39;s needed.</span>
<div class="hd-wrap" style="max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px 16px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:#1f2328;background:#ffffff;">
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">We suspended Radiance Med Spa&#39;s healdesk service at 12:20 pm EDT on Wednesday 14 October. Our Terms of Service let us do that at once when use of the service creates a legal or security risk, and say we tell you why.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Why: We saw signs that your practice&#39;s healdesk account, or an account connected to it, is being used by someone outside your practice.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">AYA has stopped answering on every channel: forwarded calls pass straight through to your direct line, and website chat becomes a contact form. Your data is kept, and you can still sign in to healdesk.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Paying an invoice doesn&#39;t lift this suspension. Reply to this email and we&#39;ll tell you what&#39;s needed to restore the service.</p>
