<title>Welcome to healdesk: your order is confirmed</title>
<style>@media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
  body, .hd-wrap { background: #0d1117 !important; color: #e6edf3 !important; }
  .hd-muted { color: #9da7b3 !important; }
  a { color: #8cc4ff !important; }
  a.hd-action { background: #e6edf3 !important; color: #0d1117 !important; }
}</style>
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#ffffff;color:#1f2328;">
<span style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;mso-hide:all;">Continue setup: four short steps, about fifteen minutes.</span>
<div class="hd-wrap" style="max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:24px 16px;font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:#1f2328;background:#ffffff;">
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Thank you for your order. Radiance Med Spa&#39;s AYA is ready for you to set up: four short steps, about fifteen minutes of your time.</p>
<p style="margin:16px 0 24px;"><a class="hd-action" href="https://app.healdesk.test/link/kP3vXq9TzR7wYb2NcL5mHs8JdF4gA6eU1oIiQ0yBtVx" style="display:inline-block;background:#1f2328;color:#ffffff;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">Continue setup</a></p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">The button works once, for the next 72 hours. After that, sign in at https://app.healdesk.test/sign-in with this address and setup picks up where you left it.</p>
<ul style="margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:20px;"><li>Your practice: check what we read from your website</li><li>How AYA works: tone, greetings and where urgent calls go</li><li>Calendar: how bookings reach your team</li><li>Your channels: what each one needs from you</li></ul>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Each step saves as you finish it, so you can stop and come back. You have until Friday 6 November to finish: if nothing is answering clients by the end of that day, the account closes. We&#39;ll remind you before then.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Your channels:</p>
<ul style="margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:20px;"><li>Website chat: after setup, you paste one line on your website and AYA starts answering there.</li><li>Phone: after setup, we show you exactly what to dial to forward calls from your main line. Don&#39;t change your call forwarding until then.</li></ul>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Your order:</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 4px;"><strong>Package:</strong> AYA Voice + Web Chat</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 4px;"><strong>Included each month:</strong> 500 voice minutes and 300 chat conversations</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 4px;"><strong>Channels:</strong> Website chat, Phone</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 4px;"><strong>Billing:</strong> Monthly</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 4px;"><strong>Monthly price:</strong> $520</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 4px;"><strong>Past the allowance:</strong> $104 for each started block of 100 extra voice minutes, and $52 for each started block of 100 extra chat conversations</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 4px;"><strong>Setup fee:</strong> Paid</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">The extra-block prices are provisional until we&#39;ve measured what each minute and conversation costs us.</p>
<p style="margin:16px 0 24px;"><a class="hd-action" href="https://invoice.stripe.com/i/acct_1Pfixture/test_YWNjdF8xUGZpeHR1cmU" style="display:inline-block;background:#1f2328;color:#ffffff;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">Your setup-fee receipt</a></p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Monthly billing ($520) starts the day AYA first answers a client. Until then, nothing more is charged. The setup fee is non-refundable.</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">To cancel online, turn off Auto-renew in Billing. Before your plan starts, that means it won&#39;t start, and nothing more is charged.</p>
<p style="margin:16px 0 24px;"><a class="hd-action" href="https://app.healdesk.test/c/glow-med-spa/billing#switches" style="display:inline-block;background:#1f2328;color:#ffffff;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">Open Billing</a></p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Your order is under healdesk&#39;s Terms of Service, version 2026-10-07.1, at healdesk.io/terms. Your signed agreement is in Billing too.</p>
<p style="margin:16px 0 24px;"><a class="hd-action" href="https://app.healdesk.test/c/glow-med-spa/billing/agreement" style="display:inline-block;background:#1f2328;color:#ffffff;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">Download your signed agreement (PDF)</a></p>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;">Questions? Reply to this email, or write to hello@healdesk.io. Or leave a message on (888) 555-0100: we reply the next business day. Please don&#39;t include client details.</p>
<p style="margin:16px 0 24px;"><a class="hd-action" href="https://app.healdesk.test/help/call" style="display:inline-block;background:#1f2328;color:#ffffff;padding:10px 16px;border-radius:6px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">Book a five-minute call</a></p>
<hr style="border:none;border-top:1px solid #d0d7de;margin:24px 0 16px;">
<p class="hd-muted" style="margin:0 0 6px;color:#57606a;font-size:13px;">You&#39;re receiving this because this is the address on Radiance Med Spa&#39;s healdesk account.</p>
<p class="hd-muted" style="margin:0 0 6px;color:#57606a;font-size:13px;">Replies reach the healdesk team. Please leave out patient details.</p>
<p class="hd-muted" style="margin:0 0 6px;color:#57606a;font-size:13px;">healdesk is a service of Viixi FZC, a company registered under the Sharjah Publishing City Free Zone, United Arab Emirates.</p>
<p class="hd-muted" style="margin:0 0 6px;color:#57606a;font-size:13px;">US mailing address (correspondence only): 800 N King Street, Suite 304-1426, Wilmington, DE 19801, United States</p>
</div>
</body>
</html>",
