  "preheader": "Continue setup: four short steps, about fifteen minutes.",
  "subject": "Welcome to healdesk: your order is confirmed",
  "text": "Thank you for your order. Radiance Med Spa's AYA is ready for you to set up: four short steps, about fifteen minutes of your time.

Continue setup: https://app.healdesk.test/link/kP3vXq9TzR7wYb2NcL5mHs8JdF4gA6eU1oIiQ0yBtVx

The button works once, for the next 72 hours. After that, sign in at https://app.healdesk.test/sign-in with this address and setup picks up where you left it.

- Your practice: check what we read from your website
- How AYA works: tone, greetings and where urgent calls go
- Calendar: how bookings reach your team
- Your channels: what each one needs from you

Each step saves as you finish it, so you can stop and come back. You have until Friday 6 November to finish: if nothing is answering patients by the end of that day, the account closes. We'll remind you before then.

Your channels:

- Website chat: after setup, you paste one line on your website and AYA starts answering there.
- Phone: after setup, we show you exactly what to dial to forward calls from your main line. Don't change your call forwarding until then.

Your order:

Package: AYA Voice + Web Chat
Included each month: 500 voice minutes and 300 chat conversations
Channels: Website chat, Phone
Billing: Monthly
Monthly price: $520
Past the allowance: $104 for each started block of 100 extra voice minutes, and $52 for each started block of 100 extra chat conversations
Setup fee: Paid

The extra-block prices are provisional until we've measured what each minute and conversation costs us.

Your setup-fee receipt: https://invoice.stripe.com/i/acct_1Pfixture/test_YWNjdF8xUGZpeHR1cmU

Monthly billing ($520) starts the day AYA first answers a patient. Until then, nothing more is charged. The setup fee is non-refundable.

To cancel online, turn off Auto-renew in Billing. Before your plan starts, that means it won't start, and nothing more is charged.

Open Billing: https://app.healdesk.test/c/glow-med-spa/billing#switches

Your order is under healdesk's Terms of Service, version 2026-10-07.1, at healdesk.io/terms. Your signed agreement is in Billing too.

Download your signed agreement (PDF): https://app.healdesk.test/c/glow-med-spa/billing/agreement

Questions? Reply to this email, or write to hello@healdesk.io. Or leave a message on (888) 555-0100: we reply the next business day. Please don't include patient details.

Book a five-minute call: https://app.healdesk.test/help/call

